# SHUTTERBUG: one coach of a ghost train in a photo stops the whole train;
# shoot one and the whole stunned train goes up together.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat quiet
cheat stop
cheat clear
cheat foe 16 230 120 0
cheat foe 16 248 120 0
cheat foe 16 266 120 0
cheat foe 16 284 120 0
cheat pos 120 120
press A
expect stunned == 4
hold B 30
expect foes_16 == 0
expect score == 1600
